<p> BORROWER   KINGDOM OF SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT ** $500	    COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    04.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.877   PAY DATE   S03.FEB.97</p>
